Space Complexity : How many elements stores in the memory

space is constant, not depend on input size :
example : through cmd arg pass n value to constant, like scanner sc; int n = sc.nextInt();
here n will shrink or grow its constant. will get once. so space complexity is O(n)

space depend on input size :
example : Arrays, depend on number of element we store O(n) -> if full then double the size 3/4 times